{"2825880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Death Howl", "steam_appid": 2825880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4126770, 4126800], "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/2aa6105d53d566bccae029a577207359.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=657 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/d31503f70916835e85d35fd2c67a309a.poster.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/d31503f70916835e85d35fd2c67a309a.webm?t=1781528133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the myth-shrouded lands where the hunter Ro begins her journey to bring her son back from the dead. Immerse yourself in the depths of the Spirit World, fractured into <strong>4 realms</strong> and scarred with <strong>13 distinct regions</strong>. Confront over <strong>30 enemy types</strong> and harness the potential of <strong>more than 160 cards</strong>, forging <strong>unique archetypes</strong> and a multitude of powerful combinations. A dark journey awaits you, spanning<strong> 25+ hours of gameplay</strong>, with numerous enthralling side quests and grim boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/5e2f8a4f7cc03e5c4807fdf6687e7965.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft <strong>over 160 cards</strong> and fashion synergistic decks that focus on <strong>poison, strength, sacrifice, retaliation, backstabbing, blocking, movement</strong>, and more. Discover shamanic totems with unique effects to enhance your deck. Each new element allows you to tailor your <strong>tactical style</strong> as you prepare for your next deadly encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/79b3546a55e531fe30b3d8a5dceb3b8b.poster.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/79b3546a55e531fe30b3d8a5dceb3b8b.webm?t=1781528133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/2dd3e7f7f23f4b23f61ef912950cae0f.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a host of restless spirits - Skulldogs, Crackle Bursts, Woeful Seashrooms and more - in <strong>grid-based battles where each move is crucial</strong>. Test your wit by fighting unique enemy types, powerful bosses, and mini-bosses, all while taking into account environmental hazards and boons. Grow stronger, adapt your deck, and choose your battles as you explore a vast world filled with dangerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/691fa9d701ca559d662368e396ff4113.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In forgotten lands shrouded by myth, Ro - a hunter from a small tribe - is overcome by grief following the death of her beloved son. Guided by voices from another world, she transcends into the realm of spirits, in hopes of bringing him back. <strong>Meet strange spirits and help them with quests and challenges that affect your deck</strong> – although not all of them may have your best interests at heart. Discover a mysterious world of <strong>forgotten lore</strong>, where darkness whispers secrets and invites you to unearth buried memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/49ee746f457a975b845f4bf9b306ddc5.poster.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/49ee746f457a975b845f4bf9b306ddc5.webm?t=1781528133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/d31503f70916835e85d35fd2c67a309a.poster.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/d31503f70916835e85d35fd2c67a309a.webm?t=1781528133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the myth-shrouded lands where the hunter Ro begins her journey to bring her son back from the dead. Immerse yourself in the depths of the Spirit World, fractured into <strong>4 realms</strong> and scarred with <strong>13 distinct regions</strong>. Confront over <strong>30 enemy types</strong> and harness the potential of <strong>more than 160 cards</strong>, forging <strong>unique archetypes</strong> and a multitude of powerful combinations. A dark journey awaits you, spanning<strong> 25+ hours of gameplay</strong>, with numerous enthralling side quests and grim boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/5e2f8a4f7cc03e5c4807fdf6687e7965.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft <strong>over 160 cards</strong> and fashion synergistic decks that focus on <strong>poison, strength, sacrifice, retaliation, backstabbing, blocking, movement</strong>, and more. Discover shamanic totems with unique effects to enhance your deck. Each new element allows you to tailor your <strong>tactical style</strong> as you prepare for your next deadly encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/79b3546a55e531fe30b3d8a5dceb3b8b.poster.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/79b3546a55e531fe30b3d8a5dceb3b8b.webm?t=1781528133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/2dd3e7f7f23f4b23f61ef912950cae0f.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a host of restless spirits - Skulldogs, Crackle Bursts, Woeful Seashrooms and more - in <strong>grid-based battles where each move is crucial</strong>. Test your wit by fighting unique enemy types, powerful bosses, and mini-bosses, all while taking into account environmental hazards and boons. Grow stronger, adapt your deck, and choose your battles as you explore a vast world filled with dangerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/691fa9d701ca559d662368e396ff4113.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In forgotten lands shrouded by myth, Ro - a hunter from a small tribe - is overcome by grief following the death of her beloved son. Guided by voices from another world, she transcends into the realm of spirits, in hopes of bringing him back. <strong>Meet strange spirits and help them with quests and challenges that affect your deck</strong> – although not all of them may have your best interests at heart. Discover a mysterious world of <strong>forgotten lore</strong>, where darkness whispers secrets and invites you to unearth buried memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/49ee746f457a975b845f4bf9b306ddc5.poster.avif?t=1781528133\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/49ee746f457a975b845f4bf9b306ddc5.webm?t=1781528133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Master the grid, defy death. Enter a grim Spirit Realm in this open-world deck builder. Craft lethal decks from 160+ cards, claim powerful Totems, and defeat foes in tactical grid combat. Fight as the desperate hunter Ro to bring her son back from beyond the veil.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Danish, Polish", "reviews": "“This deckbuilding soulslike is a must-buy for fans of either genre.”<br>9/10 – Destructoid<br><br>“I fell in love wit